      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_2919353a",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: hateful; overall-intent-description: The meme juxtaposes an image of sheep being herded with a caption 'meanwhile' and another image of men in traditional attire with the caption 'at the ISIS strip club'. The intent is to create a crude, mocking, and degrading stereotype by implying that ISIS members are engaged in sexualized or vulgar behavior, which is a harmful and hateful portrayal. This is a clear example of Islamophobia, as it uses derogatory imagery and false associations to demean a religious and political group, portraying them as barbaric and sexually deviant. The meme relies on offensive humor and visual juxtaposition to spread prejudice and misinformation, targeting Muslims and ISIS supporters with malicious intent.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_ab62b1af"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
